    <bpmn:process id="W_W1230" name="W1230. Vendor Consignment Inventory Monthly Settlement, Revenue Share &amp; Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Month-end close; consignment sell-through report generated
Frequency: Monthly; per consignment vendor (currently ~12 key vendors, ~300 SKUs)
Volume: ~12 consignment vendor settlements/month; ~300 SKUs tracked
Owner: Merchandise Analyst
Participants: Merchandise Analyst, Category Manager, Finance – AP, Vendor Account Manager
Source: workflow W1230 — Vendor Consignment Inventory Monthly Settlement, Revenue Share &amp; Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1230_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1230_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1230_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1230_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1230_Lane2" name="Merchandise Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1230_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1230_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1230_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1230_Lane3" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1230_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1230_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1230_Lane4" name="Finance – AP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1230_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1230_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1230_Start6" name="Month-end close; consignment sell-through report generated">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1230_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1230_Task7" name="Monthly consignment sell-through extraction">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monthly consignment sell-through extraction: System generates consignment sell-through report: (a) all consignment SKU sales for the month by vendor; (b) quantities sold per SKU; (c) selling price per unit; (d) total revenue per SKU; (e) unsold consignment inventory on-hand at month-end by location
Responsible (R): System / Merchandise Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1230_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1230_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1230_Task8" name="Revenue share calculation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue share calculation: Merchandise Analyst calculates vendor settlement: (a) apply agreed revenue-share percentage per vendor contract (e.g., BuildRight keeps 15–25%, vendor receives 75–85% of selling price); (b) calculate vendor&#x27;s share per SKU per unit; (c) sum total vendor settlement amount; (d) deduct any applicable chargebacks (damaged units, returns per W12A)
Responsible (R): Merchandise Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 1–2 hours/vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1230_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1230_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1230_Task9" name="Inventory reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Inventory reconciliation: Merchandise Analyst reconciles: (a) beginning consignment inventory + units received during month – units sold = ending consignment inventory; (b) verify ending inventory matches physical count (perpetual system + cycle count per W6); (c) investigate discrepancies; (d) verify unsold items are still in saleable condition
Responsible (R): Merchandise Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 1 hour/vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1230_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1230_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1230_Task10" name="Vendor settlement statement preparation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Vendor settlement statement preparation: (a) generate vendor settlement statement detailing: SKUs sold, quantities, unit price, revenue share split, deductions, net payable; (b) include aging of unsold consignment inventory (flag items &gt;90 days for potential return-to-vendor per W88); (c) prepare AP invoice for vendor settlement
Responsible (R): Merchandise Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 1 hour/vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1230_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1230_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1230_Task11" name="Category Manager approval">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Category Manager approval: Category Manager reviews and approves settlement: (a) verify revenue-share calculation matches contract terms; (b) approve unsold inventory aging action (return request, markdown request per W93, or retention); (c) approve AP invoice for payment
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 30 min/vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1230_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1230_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1230_Task12" name="AP processing &amp; payment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: AP processing &amp; payment: Finance – AP processes vendor settlement invoice: (a) create AP voucher against consignment vendor account; (b) schedule payment per agreed terms; (c) post settlement to GL (consignment payable cleared, COGS recognized per W23); (d) issue payment via bank transfer per W7
Responsible (R): Finance – AP
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 15 min/vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1230_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1230_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1230_Task13" name="Quarterly business review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Quarterly business review: Include consignment performance in vendor QBR per W1224: (a) sell-through rate by SKU; (b) revenue share profitability vs. owned inventory; (c) inventory aging trends; (d) recommend assortment changes (add/remove consignment SKUs)
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1230_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1230_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1230_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1230_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1230_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-248 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Performance &amp; Contracts (PA-03.3).) | - operational: Merchandise Analyst review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Merchandise Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1230_Assoc16" sourceRef="W1230_Annotation15" targetRef="W1230_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1230_Flow17" sourceRef="W1230_Start6" targetRef="W1230_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1230_Flow18" sourceRef="W1230_Task7" targetRef="W1230_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1230_Flow19" sourceRef="W1230_Task8" targetRef="W1230_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1230_Flow20" sourceRef="W1230_Task9" targetRef="W1230_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1230_Flow21" sourceRef="W1230_Task10" targetRef="W1230_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1230_Flow22" sourceRef="W1230_Task11" targetRef="W1230_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1230_Flow23" sourceRef="W1230_Task12" targetRef="W1230_Task13" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1230_Flow24" sourceRef="W1230_Task13" targetRef="W1230_End14" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W1230_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W1230_plane" bpmnElement="W_W1230">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1230_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W1230_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1790" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
